NAME
    write - atomically create or replace a writable file

SYNOPSIS
    write FILE [TEXT...]

DESCRIPTION
    Writes TEXT arguments joined by spaces, or standard input when TEXT is
    omitted. Publishes one complete replacement through the selected writable
    RAMFS, FAT32, ext4, or state provider. Existing ext4 inode metadata is
    preserved except for fields required to describe the new content.
